.env
node_modules/
__pycache__/
output/*.mp4
output/*.log

# Regenerable copies of projects/<id>/assets/{still,video,audio} - Remotion
# needs these physically under public/ to render (symlinks across the
# public/ boundary are blocked by its dev server), but the bytes are
# already tracked once under the canonical projects/<id>/assets/ path.
# Re-create with scripts/sync_remotion_public.py after a fresh clone, ONLY
# for projects whose public/ filenames map 1:1 to their asset filenames
# (verify by sha256 first - see that script's docstring). Add one entry
# per project you create, e.g.:
# remotion_myproject/public/still/
# remotion_myproject/public/video/
# remotion_myproject/public/audio/

# Large standalone source files archived off-repo (see
# scripts/archive_to_kaggle.py) - pointer + sha256 recorded in
# projects/<id>/state/kaggle_archive.jsonl, file stays on local disk, just
# untracked. Add one entry per archived source file, e.g.:
# projects/PRJ-myproject/input/large_source.pdf

# PRJ-ninniler-atlasi: assets/still (239M) already lives on Kaggle
# (mehmetkync16/ninniler-iin-grsel-envanter + ninniler-part2 - see
# projects/PRJ-ninniler-atlasi/state/kaggle_archive.jsonl for the pointer)
# and render/ output (~110MB/video x 10) is a regenerable, still-placeholder-
# timed draft (no music yet) - neither belongs in git history, same
# large-bytes reasoning as CLAUDE.md section 9.
projects/PRJ-ninniler-atlasi/assets/still/
projects/PRJ-ninniler-atlasi/render/
remotion_ninniler_atlasi/public/still/

# projects/_content_backlog/output/: delivered short/long video files -
# large, deliverable bytes belong on Kaggle (see kaggle_archive.jsonl-style
# pointers) or in the chat delivery itself, not in git history, same
# reasoning as CLAUDE.md section 9. production_calendar.json (tracked)
# already records each delivered item's output_path/duration for
# provenance even though the byte itself isn't tracked here.
projects/_content_backlog/output/

# projects/_content_backlog/_scratch/: working downloads (existing Kaggle
# masters pulled down to cut repurposed shorts from, faster-whisper
# transcripts used to find real cut timestamps) - large, regenerable,
# never a source of truth. The masters already live on Kaggle
# (mehmetkync16/ai-audiobook-studio-videos); re-download with
# `kaggle datasets download` if this dir is needed again.
projects/_content_backlog/_scratch/
.env.research
complete-research-ninniler-plan.tar.gz
